# thePrivator specific
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: a bare "profiles/" also matches
# src/features/profiles, which silently kept a whole feature directory out of a
# commit. Every rule here names a runtime artefact at the repository root.
.theprivator/
/profiles/
/logs/
*.log
/config.json
/profiles.json

